": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-quGML8eGcoQ7kNvwEftT87&_nc_oc=AdpuiuXum0GOJJjBnDSfj8zjR7WeGwWzE77KZZo3EK-gFSCOKZJFKHcB3rrAfSoZpFA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGhixLXhQIFOPDdrZtL2xWcCS1bD3Ey_E_0M3CfbQ1p6Q&oe=6A95DEDB"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r5YmUBcwWl4Q7kNvwGUgVpP&_nc_oc=Ado13mtYGQwPnuioCjcnoZdjJUkz-9oZA4awYCkgCJfUBjOifpHUBY_9FlRKAx1iKlU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH7athj4zlq-NvUt5_lWtQtSluENJQIfk6LdlOonU4dgA&oe=6A95CF21"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BiN1gGiz_zoQ7kNvwGmqvVN&_nc_oc=AdrFVSfMGIvw0-dRH_svUt4meqcyxMKozLWVjKI97GXxAwYYT4Ud0bc8mUCLhA1rcsE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH7gI8_4XWbRsqfq6aOgZzMHGMuzh4HKD3CbTWIylDySg&oe=6A95BBEF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wx4FGA3eVGcQ7kNvwFY8tBV&_nc_oc=Ado80vDx_aaAHEqBix_XDSHBowoeFaXgNJKFb3VlOO5NQD_g9o-AR0Kr6csQ34deZYI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQETpO8AoN5VWaShCG4y0ULVmeAcFlLaYHX4M4XxGjVFfg&oe=6A95BB92"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xuP-lrcBHEUQ7kNvwEOBeLb&_nc_oc=AdqB7ostup4xu8r0gTIz3w52zL9Z-ghu0rHKHZlKCAhTe2bJh_QisZprs-Xfvc4MCdI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEnE_45evbrLPiWrycU6yp0RkM_9PDb2J1O9WQAXtQDDQ&oe=6A95C53D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a